</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KITANO, KENICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAGAWA, YOSHIKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A composition for a roller for use in an electronic copier or a printer, which comprises a vinyl polymer (A) having at least one alkenyl group in a molecule thereof, and a roller manufactured by the use of the composition. A roller for use in an electronic copier or a printer is provided which can be directly coated with an alcohol-soluble nylon layer or the like, without a pretreatment such as application of a primer.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur une composition pour rouleaux de photocopieurs ou d'imprimantes consistant en un polymère de vinyle (A) dont la molécule comporte au moins un groupe alcényle, et sur les rouleaux fabriqués à l'aide de ladite composition. L'invention porte également sur un rouleau de photocopieur ou d'imprimante directement revêtu d'une couche de Nylon soluble à l'alcool ou autre sans nécessiter de prétraitement tel que l'application d'un primaire.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>